# Bot2's Aegis Turtle (0/5) is left with 3 damage. Bot2's own Turtle and uncrewed Air Response Unit do not count (that would be 5,
# and the Turtle would die), and the damage mode will not target the uncrewed Vehicles, which are not creatures.

